Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.33,0:00:01.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Nice move. RAJESH: I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.33,0:00:01.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-做得好 -交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:03.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Take him down. LEONARD: He's got you, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:03.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-打败他 -他要赢了 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:06.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Come on. LEONARD: He's completely schooling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:06.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-加油 -他完全超越了你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.05,0:00:09.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys, some of the other waitresses wanted me to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.05,0:00:09.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我其他服务生同事要我来问你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:11.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's Tressling. -It combines the physical strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:11.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这叫做腕力方块
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.09,0:00:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of arm wrestling with the mental agility of Tetris into the ultimate sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.09,0:00:13.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结合了比腕力的体能考验
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟俄罗斯方块的智能考验 创造出这种极限运动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's terrific, but what they wanted me to ask you is to cut it the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的很棒 但我同事要我来阻止你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, come on, guys. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 快出来 大伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:26.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}WAIT STAFF [SINGING]: Happy birthday to you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We might as well stop, it's a stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们就别玩了 反正是和局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:32.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're beating me in Tetris, but you've got the upper body strength of a Keebler elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:32.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你玩俄罗斯方块能赢我 但你的上半身力量跟矮地精差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:35.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Keebler elf? I got a Keebler elf right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:35.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}矮地精？你才是矮地精
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[RAJESH GROANING]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's a stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 就算和局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:47.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, will we be seeing you on Saturday for your free birthday cheesecake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:47.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 星期六你会来吃你的免费起司生日蛋糕吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:50.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He can't eat cheesecake. He's lactose intolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:50.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不能吃起司蛋糕 他有乳糖不耐症
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, he can have carrot cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 他可以吃胡萝卜蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What about the cream-cheese frosting? -He can scrape it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-奶油起司装饰呢？ -他可以刮掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:00:58.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget about the cake. How did you know my birthday's Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:00:58.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别提蛋糕了 你怎么知道星期六是我生日？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did your horoscope, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮你算过星座 记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:04.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was gonna do everybody's until Sheldon went on one of his psychotic rants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:04.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来要帮每个人算 直到谢尔顿开始他的疯言疯语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:06.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For the record, that psychotic rant...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:06.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所谓的疯言疯语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.07,0:01:09.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...was a concise summation of the research of Bertram Forer...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.07,0:01:09.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是贝特朗佛尔的研究结语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:12.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who, in 1948, proved conclusively...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:12.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在1948年做出了结论
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...through meticulous experiments...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}经由精心设计的实验证实
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:16.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that astrology is pseudoscientific hokum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:16.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}星象学是假科学骗局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Blah, blah, blah. Typical Taurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}典型金牛座反应
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So we gonna see you Saturday? -I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-认真的 星期六见？ -应该不会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:25.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why not? -I don't celebrate my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:25.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -我不庆生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shut up. Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:26.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才怪 你当然会庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's no big deal. It's the way I was raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那没什么大不了的 我爸妈从小就这样对我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:31.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My parents focused on celebrating achievements...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:31.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们喜欢庆祝成就
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:35.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and being expelled from a birth canal was not considered one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:35.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们认为从产道被挤出来 不算是一种成就
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:39.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's so silly. -It's actually based on very sound theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:39.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那太愚蠢了 -这是根据非常知名的理论
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:42.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-His mother published a paper on it. -Well, what was it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:42.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他妈妈还发表了一篇论文 -论文叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I Hate My Son and That's Why He Can't Have Cake"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我恨我儿子 所以他不能吃蛋糕？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: It was obviously effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实际上是很有效的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:49.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard grew up to be an experimental physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:49.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德被栽培成实验物理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:53.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Perhaps if she'd also denied him Christmas, he'd be a little better at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:53.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她也禁止他过圣诞节 说不定他会是更好的实验物理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:02:00.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I love birthdays. Waking up to Mom's special French-toast breakfast...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:02:00.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢过生日 醒来吃妈妈特制的法式土司早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:04.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...wearing the birthday king crown, playing laser tag with all my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.54,0:02:04.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}戴上庆生用的皇冠 跟朋友玩激光枪捉迷藏游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, see? That's what kids should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 看吧 小孩子都应该这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.71,0:02:09.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, that was last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.71,0:02:09.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上那是去年生日
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:15.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you've really never had a birthday party?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:15.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你从来没办过生日派对？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:17.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:17.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但是没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:20.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I was little, I'd think my parents would change their mind and surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:20.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小时候我以为爸妈会改变心意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.43,0:02:24.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This one birthday, I came home from my cello lesson...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.43,0:02:22.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我办惊喜派对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:24.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一年生日 我上完大提琴课回家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:26.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I saw strange cars parked out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:26.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到家门前停着陌生的车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:28.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I got to the door, I hear whispering...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跑到门边听到大家在低语
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:32.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I could smell German chocolate cake, which is my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:32.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}闻到德式巧克力蛋糕的味道 那是我的最爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:36.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-And? -It turns out my grandfather had died.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.94,0:02:36.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-结果呢？ -我爷爷死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:39.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, that's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:39.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 好可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it was kind of like a birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟生日派对差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:46.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got to see all my cousins, and there was cake, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:46.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我见到所有的表亲 还吃了蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:50.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's the saddest thing I've ever heard. -You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:50.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是我听过最可怜的事 -真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:52.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go ahead, tell her about your senior prom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:52.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点 跟她讲毕业舞会的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.91,0:03:20.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Make sure they remember, no peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.91,0:03:20.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确定他们不会加花生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:25.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, every Thai restaurant in town knows you can't eat peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:25.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 城里每家泰式餐厅都知道你不能吃花生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:29.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When they see me coming, they go, "Ah, no-peanut boy."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:29.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们一看到我进门 就会说不要花生的男孩来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello, Penny, Leonard just left. -I know, I wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 莱纳德刚走 -我知道 我要跟你谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What would we talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要谈什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:48.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have no overlapping areas of interest I'm aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:48.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就我所知 我们没有相同兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:51.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-As you know, I don't care for chitchat. -Can you just let me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:51.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你知道我不喜欢聊天 -你能让我进去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.69,0:03:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, all right, but I don't see this as a promising endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.69,0:03:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 但我不觉得这有什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.07,0:03:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 事情是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:04:00.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll throw Leonard a kickass surprise party for his birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:04:00.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要帮莱纳德办超炫的惊喜生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hardly think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.45,0:04:01.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard made it clear he doesn't want a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德清楚地表示他不要派对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:06.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did someone say party?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:06.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人提到派对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He just doesn't know he wants one, because he's never had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不知道他要 因为他从来没办过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:12.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I suppose that's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:12.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想那是有可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:16.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But for the record, I've never had a threesome and yet I still know I want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:16.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我没玩过三人行 我也知道我很想玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:19.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:19.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 差别在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:22.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The possibility exists Leonard could have a birthday party...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:22.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德在天塌下来之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:24.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...before hell freezes over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:24.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是有可能过一个生日派对的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. If I do have a threesome, you can't be part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 如果我要玩三人行 你不能参加
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:33.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just kidding. Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:33.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是开玩笑的 你当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:36.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you bring a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:36.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能带朋友来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.49,0:04:40.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think a birthday party is a terrible idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.49,0:04:40.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得生日派对是个烂点子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:42.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I envy Leonard for growing up without that anguish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:42.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我羡慕莱纳德的童年没有焦虑感
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anguish?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}焦虑感？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:47.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Year after year, I had to endure wearing conical hats...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:47.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}年复一年我得忍受戴上可笑的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...while being forced into the crowded, sweaty hell of bouncy castles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被逼着跳进挤满人全是汗臭味的气垫城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:52.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not to mention being blindfolded...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:52.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更别提我得被蒙上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:55.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and spun toward a grotesque tailless donkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:55.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走向没有尾巴的假驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:58.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as the other children mocked my disorientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:58.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让其他孩子嘲笑我没有方向感
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:03.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, sweetie, I understand you have scars that no non-professional can heal...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:03.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 甜心 我知道只有专家才能治好你的伤痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but nevertheless, we're gonna throw Leonard a birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们还是要帮莱纳德办生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:08.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm extremely uncomfortable with dancing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:08.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有没有说过我非常不喜欢跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:12.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...loud music and most other forms of alcohol-induced frivolity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:12.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吵闹的音乐和其他因酒精导致的轻薄行为？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Nevertheless-- -In addition--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-但是… -另外…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You either help me throw Leonard a birthday party...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你如果不帮我筹办莱纳德的生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or I will go into your bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:22.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对天发誓我会走进你的卧室 打开你的原封漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:22.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and unbag all your mint-condition comic books.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:27.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And on one of them-- You won't know which. --I'll draw a tiny happy face in ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:27.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在其中一本…你不知道是哪一本 画上快乐的笑脸 用墨水
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:33.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't do that. If you make a mark in a mint comic book, it's no longer mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:33.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能那么做 在原封漫画书上画画会毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:35.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you understand the concept of blackmail?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:35.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你知道什么叫做恐吓吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:37.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, of course, I-- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:37.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:43.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I have an idea. Let's throw Leonard a kickass birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:43.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个主意 我们来帮莱纳德办超炫的生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not the secret knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是秘密敲门暗号
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:08.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is the secret knock:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:08.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这才是秘密敲门暗号
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:13.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:13.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有什么差别？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The point of a secret knock is to establish a nonverbal signal...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}秘密敲门暗号的用意是用非语言讯号
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:19.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to verify the identity of one's coconspirators.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:19.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确定同伙的身分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:22.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Is that Raj and Howard? -Possibly, but unverified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:22.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是拉吉和霍华德吗？ -有可能 但尚未确认
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you just let us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快让我们进去好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Luckily for you, this is not a nuclear reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很幸运 这不是核子反应炉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what'd you get the birthday boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们要送寿星什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:32.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj got him an awesome limited-edition Dark Knight sculpture...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:32.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉送他超酷的限量版黑暗骑士人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:34.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...based on Alex Ross' definitive Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:34.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据亚历克斯罗斯的蝙蝠侠形象雕刻而成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:38.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I got him this amazing autographed copy of The Feynman Lectures on Physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:38.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我送他超棒的签名版《费因曼物理学》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:42.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice. I got him a sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:42.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了 我送他毛衣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:46.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, he might like that. I've seen him get chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.86,0:06:46.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 或许他会喜欢 我看过他很冷的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:50.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, I didn't see your present. -That's because I didn't bring one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:50.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我没看到你的礼物 -因为我没带
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why not? -Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -别问
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:55.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The entire institution of gift-giving makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:55.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送礼的概念太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:58.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Too late. -Let's say I go out and I spend $50 on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:58.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-太迟了 -假设我买五十块的礼物送你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:02.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a laborious activity because I have to imagine what you need...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:02.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是徒劳无功的事 因为我得想象你需要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where you know what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是你知道你需要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:07.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could simplify things, just give you the $50 directly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:07.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以将事情简化 直接给你五十块
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:10.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then you could give me $50 on my birthday and so on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:10.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以在我生日时给我五十块
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...until one of us dies, leaving the other one old and $50 richer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直到我们之中有人死掉 让另一个人比对方多五十块
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:18.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I ask you, is it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:18.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我问你这值得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Told you not to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫你不要问
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:24.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Sheldon, you're his friend. Friends give each other presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:24.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 他是你的朋友 朋友该送彼此礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:27.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I accept your premise, I reject your conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:27.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我接受你的前提 但我反对你的结论
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:33.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Try telling him it's a non-optional social convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:33.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟他说这是既定的社会惯例
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:36.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -快说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:41.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a non-optional social convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:41.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是既定的社会惯例
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:44.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:44.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He came with a manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要照说明书来对付他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Question, how am I going to get Leonard a present before the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问题是我怎么在派对前帮莱纳德买礼物？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't drive and the things available in walking distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不开车 步行可以到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...are a Thai restaurant and a gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是泰式餐厅跟加油站
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:02.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could wrap up an order of mee krob and a couple of lottery scratchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:02.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以送他一份泰式脆炸米粉跟几张刮刮乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:06.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, let's do this. I will drive Sheldon to get a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:06.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 就这么办 我开车载谢尔顿去买礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:09.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard, get rid of Leonard for two hours. -No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:09.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 拖延莱纳德两小时 -没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then, Raj, you bring the stuff across the hall and start setting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 你拿东西到对面布置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:16.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What if guests show up? -Entertain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:16.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-如果客人提早来了呢？ -娱乐他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:19.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if they're women?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:19.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她们是女人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:23.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stare at them and make them feel uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:23.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盯着她们看 让她们觉得不自在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:30.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GUNSHOTS ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:32.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:35.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:35.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:38.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How's it going? -Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:38.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:44.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So listen, the Nuart is showing the revised, definitive cut of Blade Runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:44.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 纽亚特电影院要上映 未删减的新版《银翼杀手》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:46.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Seen it. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:46.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我看过了 -不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:48.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've seen the 25th Anniversary Final Cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:48.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看的是25年周年版
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:52.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This one has eight seconds of previously-unseen footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:52.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个版本多了八秒前所未见的镜头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.49,0:08:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They say it completely changes the tone of the film.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.49,0:08:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们说完全改变了电影的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:57.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:57.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:02.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on. Afterwards, there's a Q&amp;A with Harrison Ford's body double.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:09:02.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 电影演完后还可以跟哈里森福特的替身对谈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I am in the "Halo" battle of my life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:04.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我在玩《光晕》生命中最重要的战役
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:07.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's this kid in Copenhagen, he has no immune system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:07.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这孩子住在哥本哈根 他没有免疫能力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So all he does is sit in his bubble and play "Halo" 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.50,0:09:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只能坐在隔离气泡里整天玩《光晕》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:13.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can't you play him some other time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:13.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能下次再陪他玩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:15.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not if you believe his doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:15.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生说他没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, do you smell gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 你闻到瓦斯味吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:24.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -对 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:30.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: You know, they have DVDs over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:30.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道 DVD放在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.03,0:09:34.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but they have DVD burners over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.03,0:09:34.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 DVD刻录机放在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard needs a DVD burner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德需要DVD刻录机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:40.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, a gift shouldn't be something someone needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:40.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 礼物不该是对方需要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:41.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It should be something fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:41.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该是有趣的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:46.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Something they wouldn't buy for themself. -You mean, like a sweater?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:46.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-收礼者不会自己去买的东西 -你是指毛衣吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's a fun sweater. It's got a bold geometric print.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是件有趣的毛衣 有大胆的几何图案
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:56.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is it the geometry that makes it fun? -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:56.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是几何让它变得有趣吗？ -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:59.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The point is, one of the ways we show we care about people...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:59.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重点是我们要表达对对方的关心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:02.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is by putting thought and imagination into the gifts we give them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:02.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把想法和想象寄托在我们送的礼物上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:07.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, I see, so not a DVD burner. -Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:07.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我懂了 不能送DVD刻录机 -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.19,0:10:11.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Something he wouldn't buy for himself, something fun, something like-- Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.19,0:10:11.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不会自己买的东西 非常有趣的礼物 像是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An 802.11n wireless router.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}802,11n的无线路由器
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go, Copenhagen boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 哥本哈根男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:22.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about a taste of Hans Christian hand grenade?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:23.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不要试试汉斯克利斯汀的手榴弹？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.41,0:10:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[EXPLOSION ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MOUTHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:28.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉一定很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:28.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: That could not feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:33.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, come on. Oh, you clever....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:33.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧 聪明的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接招
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:44.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:47.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHOUTING] Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the matter? -This granola bar has peanuts in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -麦片棒加了花生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:53.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, my God. Why did you eat it? -I don't know, it was just there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:53.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-天啊 你为什么要吃？ -我不知道 就放在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:57.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if I had a gun there, would you have shot yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:57.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我在那里放了枪 你会举枪自尽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:10:58.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't yell at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:10:58.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别说我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.99,0:11:01.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I've gotta go to the emergency room. -Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.99,0:11:01.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我得去急诊室 -现在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, after my tongue has swollen to the size of a brisket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 等到我的舌头肿得跟胸肌一样大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, just let me get my keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我去拿钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, oh, God, oh, God--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The laundry is out of the hamper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脏衣服从洗衣篮拿出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:20.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Sheldon, what was it supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:20.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢尔顿 应该是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine, it's out of the washer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 从洗衣机拿出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:26.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll call you when it's in the dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:26.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我放进烘干机后再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:27.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:29.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLEARING THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.53,0:11:39.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY SIGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.53,0:11:39.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（网件）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:41.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you think? -Um, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:41.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你觉得呢？ -那个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Because of the additional Ethernet ports? -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-因为有额外的以太网络端口？ -当然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He doesn't need them. He's got a six-port Ethernet switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:47.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不需要 他有六个以太网络端口
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:49.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, okay, then this one. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:49.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 这个 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:52.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. The man on the box looks so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:52.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 盒子上的人看起来很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:56.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, if I'm going to buy Leonard a gift, I'm going to do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:56.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 如果我要送莱纳德礼物 我就要送好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:59.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I refuse to let him experience the same childhood trauma I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:59.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想让他体验到跟我一样的童年伤痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:03.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know I'm gonna regret this, but what trauma?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:03.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道我一定会后悔 什么伤痛？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:08.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On my 12th birthday, I really wanted a titanium centrifuge...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:08.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我十二岁的生日 想要一个钛离心机
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:11.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so, you know, I could separate radioactive isotopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:11.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才能分离辐射同位素
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:16.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Instead of a titanium centrifuge, my parents bought me--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:16.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我爸妈没给我钛离心机 他们买了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, this is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真的太惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:23.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They got me a motorized dirt bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:23.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们送我迷你越野摩托车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:25.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:25.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What 12-year-old boy wants a motorized dirt bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪个十二岁的孩子想要迷你越野摩托车？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.62,0:12:32.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.62,0:12:32.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所有的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.34,0:12:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.01,0:12:39.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So we're getting this one? -Yeah, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.01,0:12:39.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 就买这个？ -我想是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:41.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:41.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:44.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, do you know anything about this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:44.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 你了解这些东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know everything about this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解所有这些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:49.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I have my own wholesale flower business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.56,0:12:49.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我经营批发花店
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanna hook up my computer in the front...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要连接店里的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:53.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with the one in my refrigerated warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:53.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟冷冻仓库的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:56.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Buy this one, it's the one we're getting. Happy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}买这个 这是我们要买的 快乐的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:57.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, she doesn't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:57.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 她不要那个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:13:02.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She needs a point-to-point peer network with a range extender.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:13:02.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她需要远距点对点分享网路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:04.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -Which hard drive do I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:04.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -我该买哪种硬盘？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-FireWire or USB? -It depends on what bus you have available.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-火线或USB？ -那得看你用哪种总线
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:15.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I drive a Chevy Cavalier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我开雪佛兰的车子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, dear Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:21.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We have to go. -Not now, this poor man needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:21.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我们得走了 -不行 佩妮 这可怜人需要我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You, hold on, I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 我马上过来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:27.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What computer do you have, and please don't say a white one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你用什么电脑？别告诉我是白色的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:35.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Excuse me. -Fill this out and have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:35.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对不起 -填好表格后坐着等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:37.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're throwing my friend a surprise party...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:37.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要帮我朋友办惊喜派对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I'm supposed to keep him out for two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我负责带他离家两小时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:42.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh. Fill this out and have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:42.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}填好表格后坐着等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:45.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The way I could get him to leave was tell him I ate a peanut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:45.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我唯一能逼他离家的方法 就是说我吃了花生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:47.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm allergic to peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:47.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我对花生过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:50.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, in that case, fill this out and have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:50.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么说的话 填好表格后坐着等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.04,0:13:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I need from you is to give me a BAND-AID.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.04,0:13:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只要你给我一块创可贴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can pretend I had epinephrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假装我注射了肾上腺素
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell my friend you need to keep me under observation for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟他说你们得观察我一个半小时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is that all you need? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-只需要那么做？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get out of my ER.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}滚出我的急诊室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, you don't understand. -I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 你不了解 -我了解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But unfortunately, this hospital is not equipped to treat stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不幸的是这家医院没器材治疗傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I get it. I know how the world works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.14,0:14:12.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我懂了 我知道有钱能使鬼推磨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:18.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about if I were to introduce you to the man who freed your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:18.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我介绍给你解放黑人的伟人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless my people were freed by Benjamin Franklin...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非富兰克林和他的五胞胎兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:27.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and his five twin brothers, you are wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:27.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}解放了黑人 不然你是在浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey. Sorry, I couldn't find a parking spot. How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我找不到停车位 你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:34.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bad, very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:34.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? You don't look like you're swelling up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？你没肿起来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should pick up Benadryl at the drugstore and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们该到药房买抗过敏药 然后回家去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.71,0:14:41.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We can't go home. -Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.71,0:14:41.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们不能回家 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because-- Phbbtt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because-- Phbbtt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:48.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Brisket. Brisket.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:48.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}胸肌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:50.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Water, need water. -I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我需要水 -我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.85,0:14:52.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLEARING THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny, listen, I've got a problem. -Yeah, well, so do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 听着 有状况 -对 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:02.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You gotta stall Leonard longer. -I don't think I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:02.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你得想办拖延莱纳德 -我没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:05.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to. We all have to be there to yell "surprise."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:05.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定要 我们得先赶回家给他一个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:08.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to understand something. We're in a hospital right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:08.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你必须了解一件事 我们在医院里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.41,0:15:09.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? Is Leonard okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.41,0:15:09.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？莱纳德没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:13.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard's fine. I'm fine, thanks for asking, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:13.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德没事 我也没事 对了 谢谢你的关心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:16.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I don't need your attitude. Just hold him there a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:16.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我不需要看你脸色 想办法拖延他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:20.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've done my best, but he wants to go home and I don't know how to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:20.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我尽力了 但他要回家 我不知道该怎么阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这个点子如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:24.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Keep him longer, when you get to the party...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.92,0:15:24.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拖延他 你回家参加派对时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:27.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'll point out which of my friends are easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:27.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会跟你说我哪些朋友很随便
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't toy with me, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别耍我 女人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got a former fat girl with no self-esteem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有一个不懂得自重 之前很胖的女性朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A girl who punishes her father by sleeping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有一个朋友为了惹她爸爸生气 四处跟男人上床
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An alcoholic who's two tequila shots away from letting you wear her like a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有一个酒鬼朋友 两杯龙舌兰你想做什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thy will be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:51.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定办到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:04.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm doing this for you, little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:04.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这么做是为了你 小兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:13.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, we don't have that in stock...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:13.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 仓库没货
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:16.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I can special-order it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:16.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我可以帮你订
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:18.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:18.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, sir, you don't work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 先生 你不是这里的员工
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:24.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, well, apparently, neither does anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:24.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 看起来这里也没有员工
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, we have to go. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我们该走了 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:30.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're late for Leonard's birthday party...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:30.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来不及参加莱纳德的生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and for another, I told him to call security.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我要他通知警卫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:36.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:36.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:40.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, a 6-year-old could hack your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:40.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 六岁大的孩子都能侵入你们的电脑系统
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:41.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:41.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, 1234 is not a secure password.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}1234不是安全的密码
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.05,0:16:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My friend is having allergic reaction to peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.05,0:16:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我朋友对花生过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:52.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, he's not. -Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:52.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-才怪 -就是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, sir, we are very busy here and I just don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 先生 我们很忙 我没有时间…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:56.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:00.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:00.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.69,0:17:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Code four. I need a gurney.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.69,0:17:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}四号警报 我需要担架
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:06.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Right away, right away. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:06.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-马上 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:12.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Say what you will about healthcare in this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:12.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个国家的医保一直在赔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:16.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but when they're afraid of lawsuits, they sure test everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:16.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他们害怕被告 所以什么都要检查
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:20.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: I really don't think the colonoscopy was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:20.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的觉得不必做大肠镜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before you got all swollen up...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在你全身发肿前
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I thought you're trying to keep me out of the apartment...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为你是要骗我出门
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so you could throw me a surprise party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你们要帮我办惊喜派对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:30.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, right, it's your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:30.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 今天是你的生日
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had no idea it was your birthday. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道今天是你的生日 我完全忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:37.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a lousy way to spend a birthday. Well, it's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:37.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样子度过生日太糟糕了 现在一切都结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:42.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There is a party, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:42.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们准备了派对 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:45.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe.
